			<div class="content" id="post-content-2446341">
									

<p>Once I read through the description, my initial thought was &quot;this is a blatant copy of <a href="/scp-1500">SCP-1500</a>.&quot; But then I continued reading and I found that this was executed pretty darn well. There are a couple of errors though, which I will point out here:</p>
<p>I don't see the need for the quotation marks in the first interview log.</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">As far as I can tell, there have only been thirteen members of the O5 Council (except for the highly secretive O5-14 mentioned in Dr. Clef's Proposal, but I don't think he/she would be concerned with this particular SCP due to his/her secretive location and this SCP's harmful effects).</span></p>
<p>EDIT: Yeah, forgot to read the page source. I knew there was something oddly suspicious about that area of white space.</p>
<p>However these are all nitpicky and you don't have to change them; just thought I would provide some suggestions.</p>
<p>Overall though, there was enough here to justify my upvote.</p>

							</div>

